---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Leadership | Providence Community Church | Church in Lenexa, KS"
  description="Meet the leadership team at Providence Community Church in Lenexa. Learn about the people who serve our church community."
  path="/leadership/"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px;">
      <p class="eyebrow">Leadership</p>
      <h1>Meet the team.</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.15rem;">We expect our leadership to devote themselves to understanding, enjoying, and embodying what Jonathan Edwards called &ldquo;the diverse excellencies of Jesus Christ.&rdquo; The main mission of every leader at Providence is to show us Christ.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-rule">
    <div class="wrap grid-2">
      <div class="photo">
        <img src="/wp-content/uploads/PCC_Leadership_ChrisAngela-683x1024.jpg" alt="Chris and Angela Oswald" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Senior Pastor</p>
        <h2>Chris Oswald</h2>
        <p>Chris and his wife Angela have been married for 28 years and are grateful to have their three adult children (along with their spouses) over each Sunday for a Sabbath feast full of good food, laughter, and cut-throat card playing. When he gets a moment to himself, Chris loves listening to &ldquo;Dad Rock&rdquo; on his vintage hi-fi stereo.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-rule">
    <div class="wrap grid-2">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Elder</p>
        <h2>Dov Cohen</h2>
        <p>Dov and his wife Christine have been married for twelve years and enjoy raising their four young children. Second only to his time with the Lord, Dov cherishes his dates with Christine. He also loves to explore the Kansas City region on day trips with his whole family. When he's not out and about with the fam &mdash; Dov is probably reading a book&hellip;or calling his parents just to say hello.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="photo">
        <img src="/wp-content/uploads/unnamed-4-1024x822.jpg" alt="Dov Cohen and family" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-rule section-panel">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Explore Providence</p>
      <h2>What's your next step?</h2>
      <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top:36px;">
        <div>
          <h3>Read our beliefs</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.95rem;">What we believe about the Bible instructs everything that we value as a church.</p>
          <a class="arrow-link" href="/beliefs/">Our beliefs</a>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Get connected</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.95rem;">Discover the ways you can connect and grow here at Providence.</p>
          <a class="arrow-link" href="/community/">Community</a>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Plan your visit</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.95rem;">Take the next step by learning what you can expect on a Sunday morning.</p>
          <a class="arrow-link" href="/visit/">Visit on Sunday</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
